Distorting spacetime around yourself, you reduce the movement speed of all enemies in radius 4 by 50% for [2, 2, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] turns.

You use the siphoned speed to grant yourself incredible quickness for 1 turn, increasing movement speed by [100%, 167%, 218%, 261%, 300% (TL1-5)], increased by a further [12%, 20%, 27%, 32%, 37% (TL1-5)] for each enemy slowed, to a maximum of 4.

Any actions other than movement will cancel the effect.
